%% Planned ticket lifecycle, v0.1.0, 2026-10-24.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NewTicket: Handoff or support request recorded
    NewTicket --> Triaged: Intent and reason reviewed
    Triaged --> Queued: Rules select team or general queue
    Queued --> Assigned: Authorized available staff accepts
    Assigned --> InProgress: Staff begins response
    Assigned --> Queued: Assignment released
    InProgress --> WaitingCustomer: Information requested
    WaitingCustomer --> InProgress: Customer replies
    InProgress --> Queued: Transfer with recorded reason
    InProgress --> Resolved: Outcome recorded
    WaitingCustomer --> Resolved: Policy-based closure with recorded reason
    Resolved --> Queued: Customer reopens within configured policy
    Resolved --> Closed: Confirmed resolution or configured closure
    Closed --> [*]

    note right of Queued
        Conversation is handoff_pending.
        No assistant generation or bot reply while queued.
        Show transport acknowledgment and actual queue status.
        Do not invent a response-time promise.
    end note

    note right of Assigned
        Set conversation to human_owned atomically.
        Pause assistant replies.
        Retain assignment history.
    end note

    note right of Resolved
        Ticket status and conversation ownership are separate.
        Staff explicitly returns assistant ownership
        or closes the conversation.
    end note
